    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Naval Warfare Center Weapons Division demonstrated the capability of unmanned surface vessels to capture, refuel, and release an unmanned surface vessel using a robotic towed connector. This move towards enabling persistent, unmanned operations is a significant step forward for the Navy, highlighting the ongoing efforts to enhance the fleet&#39;s ability to conduct operations without the need for human presence, which is crucial for maintaining a robust and adaptable force.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
